# Editor config for THIS checkout only. These are anchored with a leading
# slash on purpose: an unanchored ".vscode/" also matches
# cmd/bumblebee/selftest/fixtures/editorext-fixture/.vscode/..., which
# silently kept that fixture out of the repo. The file still existed
# locally, so `bumblebee selftest` passed on the machine that wrote it
# and failed everywhere else.
